<section class="vm-shipping-quote" data-shipping-quote data-api="{{ routes.root_url }}api/2026-10/graphql.json"><h2>Calcule o frete</h2><p>Consulte a entrega deste vinho na quantidade selecionada.</p><form data-shipping-form><label for="shipping-cep">Seu CEP</label><div><input id="shipping-cep" name="cep" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="postal-code" maxlength="9" placeholder="00000-000" required pattern="[0-9]{5}-?[0-9]{3}" aria-describedby="shipping-feedback"><button type="submit">Calcular</button></div></form><p id="shipping-feedback" data-shipping-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><ul data-shipping-options></ul><small>Estimativa para este produto e quantidade. O total do pedido e a entrega são confirmados no checkout.</small></section>
